<title>USA: National Semiconductor Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>National Semiconductor Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SANTA CLARA, Calif., Dec 5 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     profit $0.21	   profit $0.61</p>
<p> Shr diluted     profit $0.21	   profit $0.57</p>
<p> Net		 profit 29,500	   profit 79,800</p>
<p> Revs		661,500		  711,600</p>
<p>	  Six months</p>
<p> Shr primary     loss $1.29	     profit $1.16</p>
<p> Shr diluted     loss $1.29	     profit $1.10</p>
<p> Net		 loss 178,100	   profit 153,300</p>
<p> Revs		1,227,600		1,410,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest six month period includes restructuring charges of $256.3 million.</p>
